    "\"marketing automation specialist\" OR \"email marketing automation\" OR \"email automation specialist\" OR \"CRM automation\" OR \"CRM integration specialist\" OR \"lifecycle automation\" OR \"journey builder\" OR \"pipeline automation\" OR \"sales pipeline automation\" OR \"sales automation specialist\" OR \"RevOps automation\" OR \"GTM automation\" OR \"marketing operations specialist\""
